<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Tendering & Bid Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Maximize your win rate and ensure project profitability with structured opportunity tracking, 
            digitised estimating, and rigorous bid management workflows.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Opportunity Pipeline</h2>
        <p>
            The tendering module provides a centralized portal for tracking bid opportunities from IDBZ, public 
            authorities, and private developers. Maintain a complete register of mandatory site visits, 
            submission deadlines, and tender bond requirements, with automated alerts ensuring no critical 
            milestone is overlooked.
        </p>
        <p>
            Structured bid/no-bid workflows guide the team through a formal selection process, focusing 
            estimating resources on the projects most aligned with organizational strategy and capacity. 
            Maintain a searchable archive of historical bids and outcomes to refine future commercial 
            strategies and improve competitive positioning.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digitised Estimating and BOQ</h2>
        <p>
            Transform Bill of Quantities (BOQ) from static documents into dynamic estimating modules. 
            Perform material takeoffs directly within the system, applying validated material prices, 
            labor rates, and plant hire costs from a central rate library. Automated arithmetic 
            verification eliminates calculation errors, ensuring that every submission is structurally sound.
        </p>
        <p>
            Segment analysis allows for granular review of margins and overheads per work section. 
            Subcontractor quote comparison tools enable estimators to analyze competing vendor 
            bids on a line-item basis, ensuring that the most competitive and compliant packages 
            are included in the final offer.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Submission and Post-Tender</h2>
        <p>
            Manage the entire submission process including the generation of professional bid documents 
            and letterheads. Post-tender logs capture all correspondence, clarifications, and 
            negotiation outcomes, maintaining a complete audit trail of the deal's evolution.
        </p>
        <p>
            Upon project award, the tender estimate seamlessly converts into the initial project budget 
            and cost codes. This preserves the original estimating assumptions and enables immediate 
            budget vs. actual tracking from day one of site operations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

